<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 94,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Friday 94,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts were 94,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA reported. Saturday's actual receipts matched the estimate of 15,000.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession Friday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    57.50 -58.50	   58.50 -59.50</p>
<p>few			57.00 -59.00	   58.00 -60.00</p>
<p>Sows:  500-dn, steady to 1.00 higher, 500-up, steady to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  42.50 -45.00	   42.50 -47.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.50 -47.00	   42.50 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -49.00	   45.00 -50.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
